Subject: [PATCH] Add Bun JSX web UI for barcode batches

## Summary
- add a reusable `runBarcodeBatch` helper that wraps generation, CSV, and PDF creation
- expose the barcode pipeline through a lightweight Bun JSX server with a minimal UI and download endpoints
- wire up custom JSX runtime aliases and scripts so the web UI can render without React

## Testing
- bun run src/main.ts
- bun run src/server.tsx
